  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional capacity development for cyber security and rule of law</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will be divided into two components.
1. Cyber Security - the project aims to support the implementation of the Cyber Security Strategy: Project includes outreaching campaign, software, professional training on computer emergency response, provide capacity development in internet and darknet investigation
2. Rule of Law - the project aims to strengthen the justice system, improve access to justice, promote human rights standards by inclusion of marginalized groups.</narrative>
  </description>
